@startuml
skinparam defaultFontName "WenQuanYi Micro Hei"
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
left to right direction

title Live Tool Projector 当前组件边界

component "LiveSemanticActionRuntime\n唯一调用者" as Runtime
component "ToolInteractionProjector\n批次编排" as Projector
component "DeclaredLlmToolCalls\n声明解码" as Declaration
component "AgentInvocationCorrelator\n结果与子请求关联" as Correlator
component "ToolInteractionState\n记录、索引与 trace 清理" as State
component "ToolSemanticEmitter\naction、link 与诊断" as Emitter
database "LiveSemanticActionOutput\n统一持久化输入" as Output

Runtime --> Projector : actions / tool results / lineage
Projector --> Declaration : 解码 llm.response tool calls
Projector --> Correlator : 选择关联候选
Correlator --> State : 语义查询
Projector --> State : 记录 / 完成 / 清理
Projector --> Emitter : 已判定的转换
Emitter --> Output : actions / links / diagnostics
Projector --> Runtime : ToolProjectionOutput
Runtime --> Output : 合并输出

note bottom of State
  状态按 trace 受限
  finish_trace 物化后清理
  forget_trace 直接清理
end note
@enduml
